Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.02,0:01:36.02,staff,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(800,800)}本字幕由{\c&HFFABFC&}桜{\c&HFFFFFF&}都字幕組制作 僅供交流試看之用 請於下載後24小時內刪除
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.02,0:01:41.02,staff,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}翻譯:懶源 掛件 燕燈 時軸:VV 校對:小恐龍 壓製:晚辭秋
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.56,0:00:03.29,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}それじやはじめましょう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.29,0:00:04.94,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}甘い応酬浴びせ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.94,0:00:08.23,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}混ざらない天使と悪魔ダメっばいな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.27,0:00:09.98,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}頭リセットOK
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.98,0:00:14.32,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}視線も心もいっそ手なずけてしまおう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.46,0:00:25.21,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}それじやはじめましょう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.21,0:00:26.88,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}この気持ちの正体
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.88,0:00:30.09,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}そのくらい小学生だってわかるわ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.21,0:00:31.96,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}事欠いてプランはなし
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.96,0:00:34.51,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}もどかしい曖昧さ愚痴って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.51,0:00:37.26,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}目の前は目の前はじれったいや
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:38.18,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}ナイス!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.35,0:00:39.81,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}まだまだだけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.97,0:00:41.43,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}派手に決めるタイプ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.68,0:00:44.89,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}神の使いにあやかってラック
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.06,0:00:46.56,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}極めちやえばどう?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.77,0:00:49.06,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}ハテナは直感でかわし
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.27,0:00:51.15,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}想いかますの
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.90,0:00:55.95,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}浄土の天使はねえここですか?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.07,0:00:57.66,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}悪魔はここですか?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.74,0:01:00.58,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}裏腹な気持ち困ってんぞ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.66,0:01:02.83,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}過度な恋の刺激も限界!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.83,0:01:07.25,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}あきらかにまたド一パミン溢れて眠れない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.37,0:01:09.42,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}生命のなんたらかんたらだって
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.59,0:01:11.17,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}難しい事だって
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.25,0:01:14.92,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}なんにも入って来やしない正直ああ!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.30,0:01:19.22,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}尊いくらいやんちゃして飛ばせ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.22,0:01:21.64,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}はねたい鼓動
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.56,0:00:03.29,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}那麼讓我們開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.29,0:00:04.94,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}將你洗禮於甘甜的褒獎中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.94,0:00:08.23,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}湊不到一起的天使和惡魔看起來真不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.27,0:00:09.98,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}大腦已經設置好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.98,0:00:14.32,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}乾脆把視線和心思一塊馴服了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.46,0:00:25.21,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}那麼讓我們開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.21,0:00:26.88,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}這個感覺的真面目
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.88,0:00:30.09,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}就連小學生都知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.21,0:00:31.96,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}不做什麼計劃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.96,0:00:34.51,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}嘴裡焦急且含糊的嘟噥
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.51,0:00:37.26,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}這場景這場景看得人急死啦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:38.18,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.35,0:00:39.81,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}雖然還不夠好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.97,0:00:41.43,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}是用花俏手段解決的類型
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.68,0:00:44.89,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}是被天使選中的幸運兒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.06,0:00:46.56,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}究竟如何呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.77,0:00:49.06,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}靠直覺來改變疑惑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.27,0:00:51.15,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}能創造出回憶嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.90,0:00:55.95,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}這裡是沒有天使的淨土嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.07,0:00:57.66,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}惡魔在這裡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.74,0:01:00.58,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}不明不白地讓我摸不著頭腦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.66,0:01:02.83,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}戀愛過盛的刺激也到臨界點了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.83,0:01:07.25,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}公開戀情的多巴胺讓人悸動地睡不著
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.37,0:01:09.42,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}生命什麼亂七八糟的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.59,0:01:11.17,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}還有很難的事什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.25,0:01:14.92,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}說真的好希望它們都別來煩我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.30,0:01:19.22,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}將貴重的事物一併拋開
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.22,0:01:21.64,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}這心臟在悸動
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.65,0:20:27.50,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}例えばもしも君の　側にいられるのなら
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.50,0:20:31.54,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}叶わないと　気づいていても
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.71,0:20:34.17,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}影を探してる
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.58,0:20:35.92,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}何処へ行こう?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.88,0:20:39.46,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}何処まで行こう?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.84,0:20:44.72,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}放課後の長い道で
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.18,0:20:48.26,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}何故か寂しくなるのは
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.64,0:20:50.93,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}さよならをして
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.14,0:20:52.77,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}一人になって
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.89,0:20:56.81,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}足音聞こえないから
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.73,0:21:00.65,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}応えなんて　要らないけど
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.82,0:21:02.40,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}聞いてよ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.78,0:21:05.03,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}叶わないかな?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.28,0:21:06.74,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}遅いかな?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.99,0:21:10.33,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}許してくれるかな?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.33,0:21:13.66,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}いつも君のことを歌ったよ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.79,0:21:18.29,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}幸せを描いてきたよ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.46,0:21:24.30,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}溢れたその笑顔に　幾つ救われてきたのだろう?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.42,0:21:27.80,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}生きて歩く意味をもらったよ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.93,0:21:32.43,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}力を受け取ってきたよ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.60,0:21:38.02,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}ありがとうは少しだけ　寄り道してから
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.11,0:21:39.44,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}伝えるね
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.65,0:21:43.90,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}君の好きな　私だから
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.07,0:21:47.99,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}私も好きになれたよ
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.65,0:20:27.50,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}如果 我能待在你的身旁
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.50,0:20:31.54,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}哪怕意識到這無法實現
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.71,0:20:34.17,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}也仍在尋找你的影子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.58,0:20:35.92,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}你要去哪裡?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.88,0:20:39.46,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}你要去多遠?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.84,0:20:44.72,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}放學後的漫漫長路上
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.18,0:20:48.26,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}我之所以不由得感到寂寞
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.64,0:20:50.93,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}是因為說著再見
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.14,0:20:52.77,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}逐漸變成一人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.89,0:20:56.81,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}聽不見大家的腳步聲
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.73,0:21:00.65,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}雖然不需要回應
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.82,0:21:02.40,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}但請聽我說
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.78,0:21:05.03,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}期待能實現嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.28,0:21:06.74,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}是否太遲了?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.99,0:21:10.33,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}你會原諒我嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.33,0:21:13.66,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}我一直歌唱著你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.79,0:21:18.29,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}又描繪著幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.46,0:21:24.30,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}又有多少次 被你溢出的笑容所救贖
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.42,0:21:27.80,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}你給了我活著走下去的意義
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.93,0:21:32.43,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}我也獲得了力量
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.60,0:21:38.02,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}雖然有些繞遠 但我要對你說
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.11,0:21:39.44,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}說一聲謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.65,0:21:43.90,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}多謝有你喜歡我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.07,0:21:47.99,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}我也得以喜歡上了你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.27,0:11:23.28,PS,,0,0,0,,
